  "steps": [
    "Heat 1 tsp oil in a pan.",
    "Sauté onion, bell peppers, and boiled black chana with salt & pepper for 3–4 minutes.",
    "Whisk 1 cup skyr with water till smooth and thin. Add the chole and veggies to the yogurt.",
    "Heat 1 tsp ghee, add jeera, mustard seeds, dried red chilli, garlic, curry leaves. Once it pops, add haldi, red chilli powder & garam masala.",
    "Pour this hot tadka over the yogurt-chole mixture. Mix well.",
    "Boil 1 cup Daawat brown rice in 2½ cups water, stir occasionally till it comes to a boil. Simmer with a lid on for 12–15 mins till perfectly cooked.",
    "Serve the hot curry over rice and dig in."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Use skyr or a high-protein Greek yogurt (about 12 g protein per 100 g)."
  ],
